00:58:25,899 --> 00:58:27,359
Vehbi Hürkuş.

884
00:58:27,839 --> 00:58:29,019
Denizcan teşekkür ederim.

885
00:58:29,119 --> 00:58:30,219
Vehbi nereden çıktı ya?

886
00:58:30,579 --> 00:58:31,579
Vehbi Hürkuş.

887
00:58:32,019 --> 00:58:32,199
Evet.

888
00:58:32,539 --> 00:58:34,059
